---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | InfraOpsX"
  description="Privacy Policy for InfraOpsX, including website analytics, technical data and contact information."
  lang="en"
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
  enPath="/privacy/"
  zhPath="/zh/privacy/"
>
  <Header locale="en" switchHref="/zh/privacy/" />

  <main class="article-shell">
    <div class="container article-container">
      <header class="article-header">
        <span class="section-label">PRIVACY</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>
          This page explains what information may be processed when you visit
          InfraOpsX or contact me.
        </p>
        <div class="article-meta">
          <span>Last updated: September 21, 2026</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="article-content">
        <h2>Website analytics</h2>

        <p>
          InfraOpsX uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand aggregate
          website usage and performance, such as page views, traffic sources
          and page performance.
        </p>

        <p>
          Cloudflare Web Analytics is designed as a privacy-focused analytics
          service. It does not use cookies or localStorage to collect usage
          metrics and does not fingerprint individual visitors for analytics.
        </p>

        <h2>Technical data</h2>

        <p>
          Like most websites, the infrastructure used to deliver and protect
          this site may process technical request information such as IP
          addresses, requested URLs, browser information, timestamps and
          security-related metadata.
        </p>

        <p>
          This information may be processed by hosting and network providers
          where necessary to deliver the website, diagnose technical problems
          and protect the service from abuse.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>

        <p>
          InfraOpsX does not currently use advertising cookies or
          analytics cookies for visitor tracking.
        </p>

        <p>
          Cloudflare Web Analytics itself is cookie-free. Cloudflare may,
          depending on the security and network services in use, set cookies
          that are necessary for security or service operation.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact by email</h2>

        <p>
          If you contact InfraOpsX by email, the information you provide,
          including your email address and the contents of your message, is
          used to read and respond to your inquiry.
        </p>

        <p>
          Please do not send passwords, private keys, API tokens or other
          secrets by email.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party services</h2>

        <p>
          InfraOpsX currently relies on third-party infrastructure and services
          such as Cloudflare and hosting providers to operate this website.
          Those providers may process technical information according to their
          own privacy policies and service terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Advertising</h2>

        <p>
          InfraOpsX does not currently display third-party advertising.
          If advertising or additional analytics services are introduced in
          the future, this Privacy Policy will be updated accordingly.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>

        <p>
          This policy may be updated when the website, analytics setup or
          services change. The latest revision date will be shown at the top
          of this page.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>

        <p>
          For questions about this Privacy Policy, contact
          <a href="mailto:hello@oeax.de">hello@oeax.de</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer locale="en" />
</BaseLayout>
